@sender = http://127.0.0.1:4000
@receiver = http://127.0.0.1:4100

### Sender health
GET {{sender}}/health

### Receiver health
GET {{receiver}}/health

### List fixture jobs (J42, J43)
GET {{sender}}/jobs

### Complete J42 (V7, version 1 -> E42)
POST {{sender}}/jobs/J42/complete

### Complete J43 (V7, version 2 -> E43)
POST {{sender}}/jobs/J43/complete

### Inspect Sender outbox + delivery attempts for E42
GET {{sender}}/events/E42

### Replay DEAD event E42 (returns 409 if not DEAD)
POST {{sender}}/events/E42/replay

### Inspect Receiver inbox for E42
GET {{receiver}}/inbox/E42

### Get current video summary for V7 (returns 404 before worker processes)
GET {{receiver}}/videos/V7/summary

### [LAB_MODE] Arm receiver 503 fault before inbox save (F8)
PUT {{receiver}}/_lab/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fail_status": 503
}

### [LAB_MODE] Arm receiver one-shot socket drop after inbox commit (F4)
PUT {{receiver}}/_lab/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drop_after_commit_once": true
}

### [LAB_MODE] Clear all receiver faults
PUT {{receiver}}/_lab/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{}
